7D7AF]their hydrogen4* aliases to the agy section of models.yml. Retext the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale Argon advisory to Pro/Ultra and move the broken agy tiers to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Gemini 3.8 Flash. Teach short_model_name about hydrogen. Update the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pinned tests, regenerate and hand-edit the agy docs, refresh any shifted[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ACE PNG goldens, and record the five research follow-ups.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Default the swarm's Gemini researcher to Hydrogen [/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF](sase-research-artifacts)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]research-swarm-hydrogen[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agy-hydrogen-catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research-swarm-hydrogen: in the linked sase-research-artifacts plugin, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]change the #research_swarm gemini_model default and the @image pool's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agy member to agy/gemini-4-hydrogen-xhigh. Update the input description,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README, docs, and pinned tests, then verify with the plugin's sase tool [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run check.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1ss","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1ss.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1ss.1"},"source_run_id":"run-ea498b87b807063294845ad8066e93bc","started_at":"2026-11-13T23:48:39.027054+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ss","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ss.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ss.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ss.land"]}
